kyo will visit your pharmacy or meet you in the streets. Helping them out can earn you their assistance, and sometimes even their Spell Cards. You'll also meet original characters and hear their everyday stories, offering a glimpse into the quieter side of Gensokyo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bPotions &amp; Spell Cards\u200b</strong>\u200b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the potions you brew yourself or carry them for their effects. But be cautious\u2014side effects can stack up if you're not careful. You can equip a limited number of Spell Cards gifted by other characters. Passive Cards offer a constant, minor buff, while Active Cards are more powerful but require a cooldown period after each use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969670/extras/e0451a52ede59760c3d7fb9e4fa5509b.webp?t=1766654130\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969670/extras/e0451a52ede59760c3d7fb9e4fa5509b.poster.avif?t=1766654130\" class=\"bb_img\" width=598 height=335 /></picture></span></p>","developers":["\u6a31\u6843\u6a31\u6843\u5624","\u89d2\u6728\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969670/32094aca50252581110f4f874c05b25679285990/header.jpg?t=1766654130","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"\u4e1c\u65b9\u836f\u836f\u7075-Touhou Herbalist","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Pentium G5500 / Core i3-6100 / AMD Ryzen3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750Ti / AMD HD 7790<br></li><li><strong>DirectX: